``dials.tof_integrate``: add ``method=profile_3d_lp``, a 3D profile for long-pulse sources such as ESS NMX: a rectangular proton pulse convolved with an exponential moderator emission and a Gaussian, times a bivariate Gaussian on the detector, with variances propagated from the fit. ``profile_3d_lp.library.build=True`` fits every reflection with the shape of the nearest strong one held fixed.
